UnitDynamicSwapFeeHook::SetFeeCap
├── when caller is not Fee Manager
│   └── it should revert with "NFM"
└── when caller is Fee Manager
    ├── when pool doesn't exist
    │   └── it should revert with "PNP"
    └── when pool exists
        ├── when fee cap is 0
        │   └── it should revert with "FC0"
        ├── when fee cap is higher than max fee
        │   └── it should revert with "MFC"
        └── when fee cap is bigger than 0 and less than or equal to max fee cap
            ├── it should set feeCap
            └── it should emit a {FeeCapSet} event
